# Generated harness fixture — build output of harness/, never committed.
# Rebuilt + signed from source by scripts/build-harness.sh (CI does this
# before cargo test; locally, run it once). Keeping the binary blob out of
# the repo keeps the audited TCB's test tree free of opaque, review-invisible
# artifacts.
launcher/tests/fixtures/harness/harness.wasm
launcher/tests/fixtures/harness/harness.wasm.sig

